{"id":"ojj01bpwusdexkkzf48iqhouf","title":"Namespace团队MacBook数据中心部署方案：定制货架与虚拟化优化实践","originalTitle":"Mac at any scale","summary":"Namespace团队在数据中心部署千台级MacBook集群，通过定制货架和虚拟化技术实现自动化管理，并对比BitTorrent与自研P2P分发方案优化存储与网络效率。方案包含四类核心组件：IP KVM远程管理、定制散热架、基于gVisor的虚拟网络栈，以及利用APFS的存储优化技术。实测显示单机处理延迟达45秒，内存占用较传统方案降低30%。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://namespace.so/blog/mac-at-any-scale"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-03T14:53:42.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-03T15:51:35.356Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-03T15:51:35.356Z","category":"infrastructure","tags":["新项目","架构重构","性能提升"],"score":68,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"4b5b5540-3567-46f5-a286-d5d51b549394","title":"Namespace发布MacBook集群自托管数据中心方案"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"4b5b5540-3567-46f5-a286-d5d51b549394","title":"Namespace发布MacBook集群自托管数据中心方案"}],"topics":[{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"},{"slug":"performance","name":"性能与基准"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fNqCPwDhU9bk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}